    "stepGrammarNote": "A seed file replays against the engine doc alone, so it records only engine-touching steps and drops two pieces of scenario scaffolding: a \"deliver\" step has no `to` (the engine is the only target) and the oracle rides on each step as an `expect` field instead of a separate \"expect\" step. Restoring both would add ~100 KiB across the 50 seeds. One C# step record with optional Deliver/To/Expect fields reads scenarios.json and a seed file alike.",
